post.description:
1. Only one root user can exist; creating another returns `409 Conflict`;
2. The License is verified online; `cloud_url` is configurable and defaults to `https://api.swanlab.cn/api`
	1. an expired license returns `403 Forbidden`;
	2. a missing license returns `404 Not Found`;
	3. otherwise it returns `502 Bad Gateway`;
3. A successful creation returns `201`;
4. The root user is marked by `group.comment` set to `root`;
5. After online verification a License record is created locally for later validation.
6. A commercial license must be verified online; offline use returns `403`
